# Proxy API to deployed backend (keeps frontend code using /api/* unchanged)
/api/*  https://myclothefullstackhaile.onrender.com/api/:splat  200!

/admin/  /admin  301!

# Proxy admin pages to the backend so Render is the only authority for admin HTML access
/admin  https://myclothefullstackhaile.onrender.com/admin  200!
/admin/*  https://myclothefullstackhaile.onrender.com/admin/:splat  200!

# Canonicalize: hide /user prefix + .html extensions (explicit, avoid breaking auth files)
